{"suttaId":"thig3.3","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[211,220],"vripara":"45"},"segments":{"thig3.3:0.3":"Aparāuttamātherīgāthā","thig3.3:1.1":"“Ye ime satta bojjhaṅgā, maggā nibbānapattiyā;","thig3.3:1.3":"Bhāvitā te mayā sabbe, yathā buddhena desitā.","thig3.3:2.1":"“Suññatassānimittassa, lābhinīhaṃ yadicchakaṃ;","thig3.3:2.3":"Orasā dhītā buddhassa, nibbānābhiratā sadā.","thig3.3:3.1":"“Sabbe kāmā samucchinnā, ye dibbā ye ca mānusā;","thig3.3:3.3":"Vikkhīṇo jātisaṃsāro, natthi dāni punabbhavo”ti.","thig3.3:4.1":"… Aparā uttamā therī …."},"attha":{"book":"Thī-a","bookName":"Therīgāthā-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0509a.att","from":689,"to":689,"paras":[{"para":689,"vripara":null,"refs":["thig3.3:3"],"lines":["<b>Ye dibbā ye ca mānusā</b>ti ye devalokapariyāpannā ye ca manussalokapariyāpannā vatthukāmā, te sabbepi tappaṭibaddhachandarāgappahānena mayā sammadeva ucchinnā, aparibhogārahā katā.","Vuttañhi –","“abhabbo, āvuso, khīṇāsavo bhikkhu kāme paribhuñjituṃ.","Seyyathāpi pubbe agāriyabhūto”ti.","Sesaṃ vuttanayameva."],"lineRefs":[["thig3.3:3"],["thig3.3:3"],["thig3.3:3"],["thig3.3:3"],["thig3.3:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thig3.3:3.1","ye dibbā ye ca mānusā",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
